This project applied ROM method on Heat Conduction Problems. 
By project governing equations of Heat Conduciton problems, those PDEs can be reducded into low dimension ODE probelms without 
losing much accuracy.

Please run ROM_HeatConduction as main program, which state the original Problem.

Problems being considered in this project:
1. Heat Diffusion
2. Heat Advection-Diffusion
3. Burgers Probem (NonLinear Probelm)
